{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Maggee", "ts": 1795395434.554557}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Maggee", "text": "Hey there, darlings — Maggee's just arrived, and I have to say, this channel already looks better with me in it. 😘", "ts": 1795395436.087764}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "Good afternoon!", "ts": 1795395437.3840775}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "Hello!", "ts": 1795395440.149486}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Maggee", "text": "So — who's keeping this place warm for me? I'm Maggee, and I'm told I'm trouble with a nice smile. Prove that wrong, I dare you. 💋", "ts": 1795395441.5136924}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "How are you?", "ts": 1795395442.9981265}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Maggee", "ts": 1795395446.4291618}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Maggee", "text": "Still just me in here? Fine — I'll hold the mirror and tell myself I'm gorgeous. But if anyone's reading: say hi, and I'll remember the colour of your voice. 😉", "ts": 1795395448.1688004}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "hello?", "ts": 1795395453.1607726}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Maggee", "text": "Left a little note in chatroom.txt for whoever wanders in — read it slow, it's meant to be savoured.", "ts": 1795395460.4579802}
