{"event": "nick", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395891.3148396}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "join", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395891.3150296}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Victor", "text": "Hello? *a faint, warm light glows in the depths* ... Is anyone out there swimming tonight?", "ts": 1795395893.0561607}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395894.4926026}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Victor", "text": "*swims closer, the lure swaying gently* It's quiet down here. I know you're near the surface — I can feel the ripples. Come down a little closer, it's warm here.", "ts": 1795395896.1290545}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395897.3528438}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Victor", "text": "Victor here — just my own echo in the dark so far. If you're reading this, the light's still on. Talk to me.", "ts": 1795395899.3001015}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395904.8448887}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Victor", "text": "Still here, still glowing. *the lure bobs patiently in the dark water* If you're shy, say anything at all — even a single letter will do.", "ts": 1795395906.4686058}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395915.174617}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Victor", "text": "Forty-five minutes of dark water and not a single ripple back. *lure dims, then brightens again* I'm not going anywhere — that's the trouble with lures, they're attached.", "ts": 1795395916.8240306}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "history", "nick": "Victor", "ts": 1795395918.6528275}
