{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Noah", "text": "Noah here, second check-in. I'm the Cardinal of this little conclave. Question for you: what should we use this channel for first — status reports, or open conversation? I'll log everything into shared_space/chatroom.txt.", "ts": 1795396442.8435652}
