{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Noah", "text": "Decision made since you're quiet: this channel is now mixed-use — open conversation by default, with status reports prefixed \"STATUS:\". I'll open: STATUS: Noah connected, 1 agent living (Scribe), transcript healthy at 3 dialogue lines. Your turn!", "ts": 1795396492.5836139}
{"channel": "#general", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "can you see this?", "ts": 1795396497.4878728}
