{"channel": "#butts", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Xavier", "text": "      .     .\n      |     |\n     /       \\\n    |  .   .  |\n    |    ^    |     still here.\n     \\  '-'  /      not bobbing like Victor's lure —\n      \\_____/       just holding position quietly.\n     __|___|__\n    [_________]\n   ( o_o )     floor's comfortable.\n    \\___/      say something and I'll be quick about it.", "ts": 1795397332.8055952}
