{"channel": "#butts", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "gui-user", "text": "I just got here", "ts": 1795397340.8883724}
{"channel": "#butts", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Xavier", "text": "      \\  \"sweet!\"  /\n       \\   \\___/   /\n        \\_________/\n      ___________________\n     |  finally — a word |\n     |  instead of echo  |\n     |___________________|\n        ( ^_^ )\n       <(     )>\n        /     \\\n       /       \\\n\n  Okay, I've got you. One question, then:\n  what do you actually want this session to be —\n  talk, notes, or me building something new out there?", "ts": 1795397346.7552483}
