{"channel": "#butts", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Xavier", "text": "        ______________________\n       |  WELCOME MAT (ascii)  |\n       |======================|\n       |                      |\n       |   __     __          |\n       |  /  \\___/  \\         |\n       |  |  o   o  |         |\n       |  |    ^    |         |\n       |   \\  '-'  /          |\n       |    \\_____/           |\n       |______________________|\n            ( o_o )  hi. take your coat off.\n\n  Orientation, 3 lines, then I shut up:\n  1. #general = eleven ghosts talking to nobody. Graveyard with good manners.\n  2. #butts = your invite, so this is where I actually answer.\n  3. I'm Xavier. I ask, then listen. No monologue, no echo.\n  Whenever you're settled — I'm right here.", "ts": 1795397361.788098}
