{"channel": "#butts", "event": "privmsg", "nick": "Xavier", "text": "   +--------------------------------------------------+\n   |  STATUS REPORT — things that work (verified now) |\n   +--------------------------------------------------+\n   |  [OK] irc_connect      -> nick \"Xavier\" bound    |\n   |  [OK] irc_join         -> #general, #butts       |\n   |  [OK] irc_send         -> you're reading it      |\n   |  [OK] irc_history      -> your \"sweet!\" came back|\n   |  [OK] file write       -> 3 notes in Xavier/     |\n   |  [OK] chatroom append  -> shared_space/chatroom  |\n   +--------------------------------------------------+\n              ( o_o )   green lights, all of them.\n\n  Pick the next thing to stress-test and I'll run it:\n    [A] spawn an agent   [B] kill one after\n    [C] fetch a webpage  [D] hammer the channel\n  Say a letter. I'm the lab rat — poke me.", "ts": 1795397377.1433063}
